['“Make the home screen more addictive.”','A solution has arrived before the team has agreed on the problem.','Let’s look beneath the words.'],
['“People need to choose faster.”','Or do they need to feel more confident about the choice?','Two frames. Different work.'],
['“Five people said they would love it.”','That is a clue. It is not yet proof of what they will do.','What can this evidence support?'],
['“The idea was to help people choose.”','The prototype now seems to keep people scrolling.','Where did the reason slip?'],
['“I don’t like it.”','A preference changes the work. A reason can build judgment.','Let the maker explain first.'],
['“If the screens are faster, why isn’t the fee lower?”','The client needs to inspect the outcome of the thinking.','Let’s make that outcome visible.']
